                "subsection": "",
                "heading": "",
                "page_start": 1,
                "page_end": 1
            },
            "text": "Dispute Resolution and Grievance Redressal\nOther Provisions"
        },
        {
            "metadata": {
                "chunk_uuid": "e8c2e199-8b44-4d76-ab98-6326c4bc760a",
                "document_uuid": "73964c2f-e49e-4fcb-80d0-3769b13f74d0",
                "chunk_index": 5,
                "authority": "RBI",
                "document_title": "RBI Digital Payments E-mandate 2026",
                "chapter": "",
                "chapter_title": "",
                "section": "",
                "subsection": "",
                "heading": "",
                "page_start": 1,
                "page_end": 1
            },
            "text": "In exercise of the powers conferred by Sections 10(2) read with Section 18 of the"
        },
        {
            "metadata": {
                "chunk_uuid": "9944860b-d3d7-4986-a508-7d398c9f29fb",
                "document_uuid": "73964c2f-e49e-4fcb-80d0-3769b13f74d0",
                "chunk_index": 6,
                "authority": "RBI",
                "document_title": "RBI Digital Payments E-mandate 2026",
                "chapter": "",
                "chapter_title": "",
                "section": "",
                "subsection": "",
                "heading": "",
                "page_start": 1,
                "page_end": 1
            },
            "text": "hereby consolidates all circulars pertaining to e-mandates and issues the Directions\nhereinafter specified."
        },
        {
            "metadata": {
                "chunk_uuid": "daf6f6e7-1c22-4263-b0f9-2dea4ab531a9",
                "document_uuid": "73964c2f-e49e-4fcb-80d0-3769b13f74d0",
                "chunk_index": 7,
                "authority": "RBI",
                "document_title": "RBI Digital Payments E-mandate 2026",
                "chapter": "",
                "chapter_title": "",
                "section": "",
                "subsection": "",
                "heading": "",
                "page_start": 1,
                "page_end": 1
            },
            "text": "(a) These Directions shall be called the “Digital Payments - E-mandate\nFramework, 2026”.\n(b) These Directions shall be effective immediately."
        },
        {
            "metadata": {
                "chunk_uuid": "9bdc5d8c-ffce-43ac-a371-d5bec0662b52",
                "document_uuid": "73964c2f-e49e-4fcb-80d0-3769b13f74d0",
                "chunk_index": 8,
                "authority": "RBI",
                "document_title": "RBI Digital Payments E-mandate 2026",
                "chapter": "",
                "chapter_title": "",
                "section": "",
                "subsection": "",
                "heading": "",
                "page_start": 1,
                "page_end": 2
            },
            "text": "Providers and Payment System Participants in respect of processing of recurring\ntransactions, domestic or cross-border, using cards / PPI / UPI."
        },
        {
            "metadata": {
                "chunk_uuid": "37b941d0-b9f7-49b9-84f9-a8851a1f6a8f",
                "document_uuid": "73964c2f-e49e-4fcb-80d0-3769b13f74d0",
                "chunk_index": 9,
                "authority": "RBI",
                "document_title": "RBI Digital Payments E-mandate 2026",
                "chapter": "",
                "chapter_title": "",
                "section": "",
                "subsection": "",
                "heading": "",
                "page_start": 2,
                "page_end": 2
            },
            "text": "(a) The terms ‘authentication’, ’factor of authentication’, ‘issuer’, ‘merchant’"
        },
        {
            "metadata": {
                "chunk_uuid": "380aff3a-fae3-4e22-88f2-176bc51c818d",
                "document_uuid": "73964c2f-e49e-4fcb-80d0-3769b13f74d0",
                "chunk_index": 10,
                "authority": "RBI",
                "document_title": "RBI Digital Payments E-mandate 2026",
                "chapter": "",
                "chapter_title": "",
                "section": "",
                "subsection": "",
                "heading": "",
                "page_start": 2,
                "page_end": 2
            },
            "text": "(Authentication mechanisms for digital payment transactions) Directions, 2025\ndated September 25, 2025 and Master Direction on Regulation of Payment\nAggregator (PA) dated September 15, 2025."
        },
        {
            "metadata": {
                "chunk_uuid": "6a982665-ff78-4451-81f0-706d90612889",
                "document_uuid": "73964c2f-e49e-4fcb-80d0-3769b13f74d0",
                "chunk_index": 11,
                "authority": "RBI",
                "document_title": "RBI Digital Payments E-mandate 2026",
                "chapter": "",
                "chapter_title": "",
                "section": "",
                "subsection": "",
                "heading": "",
                "page_start": 2,
                "page_end": 2
            },
            "text": "(a) A customer desirous of opting for e-mandate facility shall undertake a one-time"
        },
        {
            "metadata": {
                "chunk_uuid": "cba279fc-a2e8-4d05-bf29-64b7d8163493",
                "document_uuid": "73964c2f-e49e-4fcb-80d0-3769b13f74d0",
                "chunk_index": 12,
                "authority": "RBI",
                "document_title": "RBI Digital Payments E-mandate 2026",
                "chapter": "",
                "chapter_title": "",
                "section": "",
                "subsection": "",
                "heading": "",
                "page_start": 2,
                "page_end": 2
            },
            "text": "validation of additional factor of authentication (AFA), in addition to the normal\nprocess required by the issuer.\n(b) Every e-mandate registered by the issuer shall specify the validity period of the\ne-mandate. The issuer shall provide the customer with a facility to modify the"
        },
        {
            "metadata": {
                "chunk_uuid": "4b020e05-b754-4fec-9c55-9c108d05ef98",
                "document_uuid": "73964c2f-e49e-4fcb-80d0-3769b13f74d0",
                "chunk_index": 13,
                "authority": "RBI",
                "document_title": "RBI Digital Payments E-mandate 2026",
                "chapter": "",
                "chapter_title": "",
                "section": "",
                "subsection": "",
                "heading": "",
                "page_start": 2,
                "page_end": 2
            },
            "text": "about this facility shall be clearly communicated to the customer at the time of\nregistration.\n(c) The e-mandate may be for either a pre-specified fixed amount or for a variable\namount subject to the overall cap fixed by the RBI. In the case of variable e-\nmandates, the issuer shall provide the customer with a facility to specify the\nmaximum value of any recurring transaction.\n(d) The customer shall be given a facility to choose or change a mode among\navailable options (SMS, email, etc.) for receiving the pre-transaction\nnotification from the issuer.\n(e) Any modification in, or withdrawal of, an existing e-mandate shall require AFA\nvalidation by the issuer."
        },
        {
            "metadata": {
                "chunk_uuid": "8330b617-d50e-46e4-83b1-f258824076c2",
                "document_uuid": "73964c2f-e49e-4fcb-80d0-3769b13f74d0",
                "chunk_index": 14,
                "authority": "RBI",
                "document_title": "RBI Digital Payments E-mandate 2026",
                "chapter": "",
                "chapter_title": "",
                "section": "",
                "subsection": "",
                "heading": "",
                "page_start": 2,
                "page_end": 3
            },
            "text": "(a) The first transaction under an e-mandate shall require AFA validation. If the\nfirst transaction is processed along with registration of the e-mandate, then\nAFA validation may be combined.\n(b) Payments under e-mandates shall not be subject to any other limits / controls\nset by the customer."
        },
        {
            "metadata": {
                "chunk_uuid": "b748ffef-ffbc-4f1e-adde-2effed8a2ef6",
                "document_uuid": "73964c2f-e49e-4fcb-80d0-3769b13f74d0",
                "chunk_index": 15,
                "authority": "RBI",
                "document_title": "RBI Digital Payments E-mandate 2026",
                "chapter": "",
                "chapter_title": "",
                "section": "",
                "subsection": "",
                "heading": "",
                "page_start": 3,
                "page_end": 3
            },
            "text": "(a) An issuer shall send a pre-transaction notification to the customer, at least 24\nhours prior to the actual charge / debit.\n(b) The pre-transaction notification shall, at the minimum, inform the customer\nabout the merchant’s name, transaction amount, date / time of debit, reference\nnumber of e-mandate, reason for debit, i.e., e-mandate registered by the\ncustomer.\n(c) The issuer shall provider a customer with a facility to opt-out of any particular\ntransaction or the e-mandate. Any such opt-out shall be validated by the issuer\nusing AFA. An intimation to this effect shall be sent to the customer.\n(d) Pre-transaction notification is not required for e-mandates registered to auto-\nreplenish balances of FASTag, and National Common Mobility Card (NCMC)."
        },
        {
            "metadata": {
                "chunk_uuid": "4045d0b9-35f1-4ed7-bf8e-5a876e1fb098",
                "document_uuid": "73964c2f-e49e-4fcb-80d0-3769b13f74d0",
                "chunk_index": 16,
                "authority": "RBI",
                "document_title": "RBI Digital Payments E-mandate 2026",
                "chapter": "",
                "chapter_title": "",
                "section": "",
                "subsection": "",
                "heading": "",
                "page_start": 3,
                "page_end": 3
            },
            "text": "notification shall, at the minimum, inform the customer about the merchant’s"
        },
        {
            "metadata": {
                "chunk_uuid": "8106715c-6c59-4644-8cda-792b125219aa",
                "document_uuid": "73964c2f-e49e-4fcb-80d0-3769b13f74d0",
                "chunk_index": 17,
                "authority": "RBI",
                "document_title": "RBI Digital Payments E-mandate 2026",
                "chapter": "",
                "chapter_title": "",
                "section": "",
                "subsection": "",
                "heading": "",
                "page_start": 3,
                "page_end": 3
            },
            "text": "transaction and e-mandate, reason for debit, i.e., e-mandate registered by the\ncustomer, and details on grievance redressal1."
        },
        {
            "metadata": {
                "chunk_uuid": "edc00842-25ed-4fa2-9490-48d756c17767",
                "document_uuid": "73964c2f-e49e-4fcb-80d0-3769b13f74d0",
                "chunk_index": 18,
                "authority": "RBI",
                "document_title": "RBI Digital Payments E-mandate 2026",
                "chapter": "",
                "chapter_title": "",
                "section": "",
                "subsection": "",
                "heading": "",
                "page_start": 3,
                "page_end": 3
            },
            "text": "(a) All recurring transactions may be authorised without AFA up to ₹15,000/- per\ntransaction. Transactions above this amount shall be subject to AFA.\n(b) Payment of insurance premiums, subscription to mutual funds, and credit card\nbill payments may be made without AFA up to ₹1,00,000/- per transaction."
        },
        {
            "metadata": {
                "chunk_uuid": "f149bf6e-ba28-46a0-a546-43197a956bea",
                "document_uuid": "73964c2f-e49e-4fcb-80d0-3769b13f74d0",
                "chunk_index": 19,
                "authority": "RBI",
                "document_title": "RBI Digital Payments E-mandate 2026",
                "chapter": "",
                "chapter_title": "",
                "section": "",
                "subsection": "",
                "heading": "",
                "page_start": 3,
                "page_end": 4
            },
            "text": "(a) An appropriate dispute redressal system shall be put in place by the issuer to\nfacilitate the customer to lodge grievance/s.\n(b) RBI instructions on limiting liability of customers for unauthorised transactions\nshall be applicable to recurring transactions under e-mandates as well.\n1 The requirement for providing details of grievance redressal is added, based on feedback."
        },
        {
            "metadata": {
                "chunk_uuid": "f249e930-135c-4b25-8291-46e49b710bd3",
                "document_uuid": "73964c2f-e49e-4fcb-80d0-3769b13f74d0",
                "chunk_index": 20,
                "authority": "RBI",
                "document_title": "RBI Digital Payments E-mandate 2026",
                "chapter": "",
                "chapter_title": "",
                "section": "",
                "subsection": "",
                "heading": "",
                "page_start": 4,
                "page_end": 4
            },
            "text": "(a) No charges shall be levied to the customer for availing the e-mandate facility\nfor recurring transactions.\n(b) In case of cards, existing e-mandate(s) can be mapped to reissued cards2.\n(c) An acquirer shall ensure compliance with these directions by merchants on-\nboarded by them."
        },
        {
            "metadata": {
                "chunk_uuid": "5c56a3be-6f23-4d28-8ea4-52f40a12c796",
                "document_uuid": "73964c2f-e49e-4fcb-80d0-3769b13f74d0",
                "chunk_index": 21,
                "authority": "RBI",
                "document_title": "RBI Digital Payments E-mandate 2026",
                "chapter": "",
                "chapter_title": "",
                "section": "",
                "subsection": "",
                "heading": "",
                "page_start": 4,
                "page_end": 4
            },
            "text": "With the issue of these directions, the instructions/guidelines contained in the\nfollowing circulars, issued by the Reserve Bank stand repealed."
        },
        {
            "metadata": {
                "chunk_uuid": "cbe2f5b8-c56d-4ab6-9fc8-1a69aee7b00e",
                "document_uuid": "73964c2f-e49e-4fcb-80d0-3769b13f74d0",
